# Empty, and meant to stay that way.
#
# This file held 3,398 suppressions when ticket 40 started and none now. `analyse` is clean at
# level 8, so an error has nowhere to hide: a new one fails CI on the spot instead of being
# regenerated into this file and forgotten.
#
# PhpstanBaselineRatchetTest asserts this list is empty. If you are about to add an entry here,
# that test will tell you not to -- fix the code, or, when the report is genuinely wrong about
# a package that is not installed or a guard the analyser cannot model, add a documented
# `ignoreErrors` entry to phpstan.neon with the reason written next to it, as the six there do.
parameters:
	ignoreErrors: []
